---
description: Project rules for meeting-manager-backend (all agents)
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repo root — it is the single source of rules (stack, structure, patterns, ownership, workflow).

Key points:
- `docs/api-contract.md` is the source of truth; never change it in a feature PR.
- Cursor owns WS-B Auth only: `src/modules/auth/**` (implement `createAuthenticate` in `authenticate.ts`) and `test/auth/**`. Origin guard and auth guard are shared and already mounted.
- Use `AppError`, `parseBody/parseQuery/parseParams`, `deps.db`, `deps.now()`, `req.log`; ESM `.js` imports.
- Never log passwords, OTP codes, cookies, tokens, emails or bodies. No JWT. No new dependencies without asking.
- Done = typecheck + tests + build green; Conventional Commits in English.
